macOS: use LLVM ar for ring's wasm objects, not Apple's ar. Install
rustup component add llvm-tools-preview, then set AR_wasm32_unknown_unknown
to <sysroot>/lib/rustlib/<host>/bin/llvm-ar. If changing archivers after a
failed build, clean ring for this target before rebuilding.

If dependency versions change, refresh THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt from the exact
normal/build cargo tree for wasm32-unknown-unknown and their registry licenses.
The regular GUI build validates checksums and does not invoke Rust or any relay.
